{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"暖かくなってくるだけでワクワクするね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！97回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nおひささんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/09/1368577/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/09/1368577/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/09/1368577/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/09/1368577/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  Tsuyoshiさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎あとまいちゅんがねオールナイトニッポンZEROでひなこに毎年誕生日プレゼントあげてるのに帰ってきたことないって言ってたよ♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎まいちゅんに心の底からあげたいものが見つかってから、プレゼントしよう！と思ってたら、早3年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな言い訳を言わないで済むように\n私の誕生日が来る前に\n3年分のプレゼントをしたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  三蔵さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎今日は「BOMB」の撮影お疲れ様！"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:64F0EAC33B1D8EBE528AA3F7D74EDDC4-03@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、蘭世との撮影は楽しめたかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎楽しかったよ～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんが友達に聞いた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「肯定してくれる人が2割。否定する人も2割。どっちにも一定数の人がいるのは変わらないから、残りの6割をどうなるかは自分次第」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう言葉を取材中に聞けて\nあらたに考えることができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんとお話ししたい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その言葉を言ってくれた\nひめちゃんのお友達ともお話ししたい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世ちゃんもいつも通りの\n蘭世節が効いてて、面白くてかっこよかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  けいまるさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん、こんばんは～！\nブロク更新ありがとう。\n解禁になるのを楽しみに待ってます笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎こんばんは！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらこそ、皆さんいつもコメントありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"解禁されるのは、私もとても楽しみです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワク～ワクワク～ワクワク～ワクワ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(409)  いなしゅんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎お疲れ様！\nガールズアワード頑張ってp(^-^)q"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎とても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  ふくだるま＆かにょまるさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんより、チップの方が可愛い✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そんな、当たり前じゃないですか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップは、誰よりも何よりも可愛いんだから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/09/1368577/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/09/1368577/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n88回目はまさまさハーデスさんからです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん占い\n明日はなんと！\n皆さん幸せな１日をおくれるでしょう！"}],"source":"archive"}